    "Safari 的 cookie 放在系統保護的位置。要授權的是 **Foldwall**，不是 yt-dlp——子行程的授權判定歸屬於把它叫起來的那個 app。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Safari keeps its cookies in a system-protected location. The app that needs permission is **Foldwall**, not yt-dlp: a child process is judged by whichever app launched it."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Safari 的 cookie 放在系统保护的位置。要授权的是 **Foldwall**，不是 yt-dlp——子进程的权限判定归属于把它叫起来的那个 app。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Safari 的 cookie 放在系統保護的位置。要授權的是 **Foldwall**，不是 yt-dlp——子行程的授權判定歸屬於把它叫起來的那個 app。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
