    "掃描順序：自訂路徑 → PATH → 常見安裝位置。Foldwall 不經手任何 API key，計費在你自己的訂閱上。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Scan order: custom path → PATH → common install locations. Foldwall never touches an API key; usage is billed to your own subscription."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "扫描顺序：自定义路径 → PATH → 常见安装位置。Foldwall 不经手任何 API key，计费在你自己的订阅上。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "掃描順序：自訂路徑 → PATH → 常見安裝位置。Foldwall 不經手任何 API key，計費在你自己的訂閱上。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "授權": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "License"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "许可"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "授權"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "換掉一台 Mac 時用這裡把舊機的桌布設定接過來。**會覆蓋這台目前的設定。**從**別台**匯入時會跳過「此螢幕改用影片」與「借瀏覽器 cookie」——前者存的是顯示器 UUID、每台都不同，後者的授權在新機器上本來就要重來。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Use this to carry an old Mac's wallpaper settings over when you replace it. **It overwrites this Mac's current settings.** Importing from **another** Mac skips “play video on this screen” and “borrow browser cookies”: the first stores display UUIDs, which differ on every machine, and the second needs its permissions granted again on the new one anyway."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "换掉一台 Mac 时用这里把旧机的壁纸设置接过来。**会覆盖这台目前的设置。**从**别台**导入时会跳过“此屏幕改用视频”与“借浏览器 cookie”——前者存的是显示器 UUID、每台都不同，后者的授权在新机器上本来就要重来。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
