    "會員限定、年齡限制、私人的片單，沒有登入狀態就是解不出來；有些站也把較好的那幾條流留給登入的人。YouTube 擋自動化時（「Sign in to confirm you're not a bot」）同樣要靠它才過得去。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Members-only, age-restricted, and private playlists simply cannot be resolved without a signed-in session, and some sites reserve their better streams for signed-in viewers. It is also what gets you past YouTube’s “Sign in to confirm you’re not a bot”."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "会员限定、年龄限制、私人的播放列表，没有登录状态就是解不出来；有些站也把较好的那几条流留给登录的人。YouTube 拦自动化时（“Sign in to confirm you're not a bot”）同样要靠它才过得去。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "會員限定、年齡限制、私人的片單，沒有登入狀態就是解不出來；有些站也把較好的那幾條流留給登入的人。YouTube 擋自動化時（「Sign in to confirm you're not a bot」）同樣要靠它才過得去。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "有 %lld 個來源離線或無權限": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld sources are offline or unreadable"
          }
        },
