    "有新版 %@。網站一改版 extractor 就會解不出東西，先更新再排查比較省事：": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Version %@ is available. Extractors stop working as soon as a site changes, so updating first is usually less work than debugging:"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "有新版 %@。网站一改版 extractor 就会解不出东西，先更新再排查比较省事："
