    "沒偵測到 `%@`。裝好之後按「重新掃描」，或填入執行檔的完整路徑：": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "`%@` was not found. Install it and click Rescan, or enter the full path to the executable:"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "没检测到 `%@`。装好之后点“重新扫描”，或填入可执行文件的完整路径："
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "沒偵測到 `%@`。裝好之後按「重新掃描」，或填入執行檔的完整路徑："
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "沒有 ffmpeg——`brew install ffmpeg`。YouTube 這類站只提供分離的視訊／音訊軌，沒有它就合併不了，片單一支也抓不下來。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No ffmpeg — `brew install ffmpeg`. Sites like YouTube only serve separate video and audio tracks; without it they cannot be merged, and not a single playlist video will download."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "没有 ffmpeg——`brew install ffmpeg`。YouTube 这类站只提供分离的视频／音频轨，没有它就合并不了，播放列表一个也抓不下来。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "沒有 ffmpeg——`brew install ffmpeg`。YouTube 這類站只提供分離的視訊／音訊軌，沒有它就合併不了，片單一支也抓不下來。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
