    "資料夾、網路來源、片單的**定義**寫在共用的 `sources.json`。在一台加的來源，別台也會出現；在一台刪掉的，別台也會清掉。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The **definitions** of folders, network sources and playlists live in a shared `sources.json`. Add a source on one Mac and it shows up on the others; delete it on one and it clears everywhere."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "文件夹、网络来源、播放列表的**定义**写在共用的 `sources.json`。在一台加的来源，别台也会出现；在一台删掉的，别台也会清掉。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
